---
import { Calendar } from "lucide-astro";
---

<section id="contact" class="reveal-card relative w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto rounded-3xl border border-[rgba(164,6,233,0.15)] overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 lg:p-16 my-12" style="background-image: linear-gradient(152.4deg, rgb(15, 15, 18) 0%, rgb(26, 18, 48) 38.89%, rgb(42, 14, 85) 70.71%)">
  <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-80 h-80 bg-brand-orange/15 blur-3xl rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 w-80 h-80 bg-brand-purple/15 blur-3xl rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-8 z-10 w-full max-w-3xl">
    <div class="font-bold text-3xl md:text-[44px] leading-tight text-white">
      <h2>Deja de adivinar el siguiente paso.</h2>
      <p class="bg-clip-text bg-linear-to-r from-brand-orange to-brand-yellow text-transparent mt-1">Vamos a construirlo.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="text-[#c6cad0] text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      Eliges tu hora en un par de clics y empezamos a auditar tu stack, resolver bloqueos de arquitectura o diseñar tu estrategia de IA directamente.
    </p>

    <div class="w-full max-w-md flex flex-col gap-4 items-center">
      <a href="https://calendly.com/tokidev/sesion-gratuita" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-full bg-linear-to-r from-brand-orange to-brand-yellow flex h-14 items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 rounded-full shadow-[0px_12px_28px_-4px_rgba(245,57,85,0.35)] text-white text-sm sm:text-base font-bold hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform">
        <Calendar size={18} />
        Agendar mi sesión en Calendly
        <span class="ml-1">→</span>
      </a>
      <p class="text-[#8c8f9e] text-xs">Respondo en menos de 24h. Sin compromiso, solo conversamos.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
